  "description": "Why Trash Stocks are Important...and What To Do With The Information",
  "body_html": "<p><em>👋 Welcome to a<strong> 🔒 subscriber-only post🔒 </strong></em>where I discuss thoughts on my next moves in the stock market.  I’ll confess now, I think <em><strong>the move is profitable, but not necessarily “exciting”</strong></em>. We have locked down some pretty big wins for 2025, listed below, but right now my mindset is <em><strong>gradually </strong></em>shifting from “risk-on” to “risk-off”. You may recall yesterday’s post, that it was <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-market-trash-season?r=4z8lgl\">Trash Season in the stock market</a>….and this offers a major signal and clue as to what the optimal strategy going forward is. </p><ul><li><p>2025 Winners: </p><ul><li><p>🥇RBLX +52.3%</p></li><li><p>🥈 TTMI +22%</p></li><li><p>🥉 WNS +14%</p></li></ul><p></p></li></ul><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://www.stocktokdashboard.com/\">StockTokDashboard</a></strong></em> <em><strong>|</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a></strong></em> <em><strong>| <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a> </strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to the Stock Screener. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a> </strong></em></p><p>Now…the next move I am thinking about….👇</p>",
